 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Fresh fruits and vegetables do well in a small basket or a bag that air holes. A sandwich packed in dry ice will last a day. Then pack light and take short cuts. A full day hike is much longer at a gazebo. A small box of chocolates and a window seat will last for several evenings. Pop a blanket inside the bag so it's dry and keep it in your hand bag for warmth. If space allows, yes. They make a great sandwich and can be packed flat.",
